% Ada 83 regression fixture for the AWEB toolchain.
% Demonstrates only Ada 83 reserved words.
\input awebmac

@* Ada 83 sample. This module exists to verify that an
unmodified Ada 83 program still tangles and weaves correctly
under release 2.0 of the toolchain.

@a
with TEXT_IO;
procedure HELLO_83 is
begin
   TEXT_IO.PUT_LINE("hello, ada 83");
end HELLO_83;
